"Ennis's bottle crate holds two crystal mage vials; one has dried blue healing potion crusted inside."
"Ennis thinks the crystal vials are plain glass, and has not noticed the crust."
"Madam Orla in Bramwick would pay a quarter-penny a vial, and more if she saw the crust."
"Under his gruffness Ennis is lonely, and a helper who works hard and doesn't steal would win him."
